WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.371
Lab 2 uses a test tenant with
a leaver workflow in the

2
00:00:03.371 --> 00:00:06.537
workbook's leaver order;
the authors haven't run it.

3
00:00:06.537 --> 00:00:09.762
Register a reader app with
only the two permissions.

4
00:00:09.762 --> 00:00:14.769
Give one test user a leave date a few
hours ahead and wait for the scheduled run,

5
00:00:14.769 --> 00:00:17.350
and run the leaver on demand for a second.

6
00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.471
Export the logs, and
confirm which activity the

7
00:00:20.471 --> 00:00:23.512
revoke task really wrote,
and who initiated it.

8
00:00:23.512 --> 00:00:24.487
Then measure.

9
00:00:24.487 --> 00:00:27.626
Each block should include the
wait for the tenant schedule.

10
00:00:27.626 --> 00:00:29.640
Finally, back everything out.
